# Data Spaces Symposium 2027.
#
# The symposium is organised by IDSA together with the Data Spaces Support
# Centre (DSSC), BDVA, Gaia-X and other partners. IDSA is recorded as both the
# event's standards-body scope (ex:sdo) and its organizer. The page gives
# 9-10 March 2027, 08:00-17:30 UTC+01:00 each day; the dates below are those
# times converted to UTC (Europe/Brussels is still on CET in March).
#
# Source: https://internationaldataspaces.org/events/data-spaces-symposium-2027-value-at-scale-trust-by-design/
# Snapshot: 2026-11-19.
#
# The venue is The EGG, Rue Bara 175, Brussels. ex:atLocation reuses the
# existing Brussels city node from data/locations.ttl (the event page supplies
# the street venue as ex:location).
#
# Seeded with `devbox run seed -- static` (see scripts/fuseki.ts).

